    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/907210/extras/e2f211c8a084c1e73e655cd4183ec611.avif?t=1749380875\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are evildoers in every society. Dishonest traders who defraud innocent people of their money. And shameless aristocrats who exploit the poor into starvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But there is a group of chivalrous thieves that only targets such criminals. The group is called &quot;Cat's Punch.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In their performance-enhancing suits, the beautiful and elegant women of the group evade through traps and enemies to steal the treasures of those who would oppress society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>From the creators of Treasure Hunter Claire and President Yukino, comes a Stealth Action game brought to you in native English!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various Enemies</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various Traps</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voiced Main Cast</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animation</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/907210/extras/e2f211c8a084c1e73e655cd4183ec611.avif?t=1749380875\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are evildoers in every society. Dishonest traders who defraud innocent people of their money. And shameless aristocrats who exploit the poor into starvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But there is a group of chivalrous thieves that only targets such criminals. The group is called &quot;Cat's Punch.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In their performance-enhancing suits, the beautiful and elegant women of the group evade through traps and enemies to steal the treasures of those who would oppress society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>From the creators of Treasure Hunter Claire and President Yukino, comes a Stealth Action game brought to you in native English!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various Enemies</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various Traps</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voiced Main Cast</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animation</p></li></ul>",
